Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:59:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] FeatureGate: add FeatureGateService and
 FeatureGateManager

FeatureGateService runs in system_server, published as 'feature_gate'.
Rules kept in memory; queries open to all; setRule/removeRule limited
to system/shell/root UIDs until a real permission is added.
FeatureGateManager registered in SystemServiceRegistry.

Change-Id: I0ec2ef2914d7c554ef4aa60e5321cae1e7a151b5
